  "validationNotes": {
    "coverage": "66 focused tests cover both seats and both owners of dynamic five-color Verde, noncreature battlefield cards, unavailable colors and paid/G-zero execution, all own destruction bundles, simultaneous whole-board destruction and external protection on ignored recipients. Full Prince paid summon, ordinary other-own paid/free/mana summons versus nonsummon/enemy/self, optional decline, exact recipient and public one-card reveal, partial multicolor match, distinct twinpact creature/spell colors, colorless not a civilization, mandatory evolution, entry prevention, deck inspection lock, queued departed source, encrypted restore and two actual encrypted duel-service QA39323 replays. 294 related and five online tests pass.",
    "resolvedAttempts": "Initial new-card condition used g370 sumBoth, which reads enemy changing civilizations using the requesting owner; replaced only this new specification with the existing g334Both per-owner all-battlefield-card condition. No older card specification or shared counter changed. Test fixtures corrected Prince summoning sickness using a real turn cycle, a genuine non-summon-entry prohibition (Senno rather than an unrelated GR lock), and a real Fire Bird evolution base.",
    "batchSize": "Keep the two-card QA39323 cohort complete rather than force a third card whose extra rulings still need another full implementation. Next official evidence is already downloaded for Mestapo and Amate Radial; unregistered and uncounted until their full interactions are implemented.",
    "reprints": "All three Offanis official prints and the one Prince official print reviewed in full with unchanged original IDs and raw detail rows."
  }
